Compilation only; full local build log retained outside Git.
Project build complete. To flash, run:
 idf.py flash
or
 idf.py -p PORT flash
or
 python -m esptool --chip esp32s3 -b 460800 --before default_reset --after hard_reset write_flash --flash_mode dio --flash_size 16MB --flash_freq 80m 0x0 build-idf-5.3.2-rev12-tls-bench/bootloader/bootloader.bin 0x8000 build-idf-5.3.2-rev12-tls-bench/partition_table/partition-table.bin 0x10000 build-idf-5.3.2-rev12-tls-bench/tv4_hmi.bin
